Upgrade functionality: 
Upgrading food quantity is signficiantly lower for higher rarities. The cost grows exponentially with additional stars.

Cost function:
    Cost = (CurrStar + 1)(2^(CurrStar + 5)) / RarityDivFactor

RarityDivFactor:
    Common: 1
    Uncomomn: 2
    Rare: 3
    Epic: 4
    Legendary: 5
    Mythical: 6

functions:

upgradeHandler
upgradeCost
upgradeStars